Spec: Transactional server authority with external rollback witness

Purpose:
  Preserve exact owner-approved roles, services and grants without reviving stale generations or restored databases.

Owns:
  ./store.go
  ./store_test.go

Must:
  Accept only a host-protected bbolt database with synchronization enabled and an independent durable witness outside database backups.
  Compare immutable expected revisions, retain caller/operation/digest results and reserve one operation for revoking each active object.
  Atomically invalidate dependent grants on device/service generation changes and deny the removal of the last active owner.
  Prepare the witness before database commit and acknowledge after; ambiguous ahead-of-database or missing witness state fails closed, never resets authority.
  Finalize a prepared witness only when committed database generation and digest exactly match it.
  Keep time high-water and bounded object counts, validate stored shapes and expose fixed errors without raw state.
  Expose current publication snapshots only after active publisher role, matching device generation, and approved service validation.
